{"title":"2016 OIM Problems/Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_OIM_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Find all positive real solutions of the system of equations:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/5/1/2513d4ba98934cba664f2fc82001e413254ac2ec.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x=\\frac{1}{y^2+y-1},\\; y=\\frac{1}{z^2+z-1},\\; z=\\frac{1}{x^2+x-1}\\]\" width=\"379\" height=\"40\" />\n</p><p>~translated into English by Tomas Diaz. ~orders@tomasdiaz.com\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_OIM_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Clearly <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/f/9/0f9fa1129cb38517beada9aec067527cde7b87ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{(1,1,1)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"69\" height=\"29\" /> works. We then prove that no other solutions exist.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/d/9/0d9c3b1c142cbd3f8217dabc160c57e4750df241.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"21\" height=\"18\" /> First, if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/6/d/66db4e19b3be56d841f02880243f258ec5d1e88b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x&gt;1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"42\" height=\"12\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/1/3/31371ae2e72da5a5678f8f7dccb3b0ae74454ed8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y^2+y-1=\\frac{1}{x}&lt;1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"154\" height=\"38\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/b/5/5b50c082c896e06522f81699813edb258b1d772c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y^2+y-2&lt;0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"115\" height=\"20\" /> and thus <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/d/b/1db8b9652ce4adb835b95474cb6a4e352f55f269.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y\\in(-2,1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"88\" height=\"20\" />. Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> must be positive, then we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/8/e/48eaf84d61d401216862cc751740724511e8a317.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0&lt;y&lt;1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"78\" height=\"17\" />.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/f/62f62a19f0425d8e6121ca0c1cfd3ce96e43c9c5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(2)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"21\" height=\"18\" /> Next, if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/2/8/128206b7583760e7ef76e802861294c334f7ca2b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0&lt;x&lt;1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"76\" height=\"13\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/0/ad03f0f900c613144ee46148e590e3b1a3afa1a6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y^2+y-1=\\frac{1}{x}&gt;1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"154\" height=\"38\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/e/6/8e658ae1cc83b428efb72e6559f79dfa0979bd25.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y^2+y-2&gt;0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"115\" height=\"20\" /> and thus <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/7/fc7ca7dc62f3d274c51ef6b5228d38182fd8f621.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y\\in(-\\infty,-2)\\cup(1,\\infty)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"181\" height=\"20\" />. Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> must be positive, then we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/9/8/b9845c168b2536a28057556dfc680eef7f658833.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y&gt;1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"42\" height=\"15\" />.\n</p><p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/c/5/4c52e02a35db152495396584bfeae1d0599cd753.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" /> implies that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/3/6c3b4834614e5e7e189cb7d621cfb4fb0bd36dd7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"42\" height=\"15\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/b/d/6bd3d68e77a39e1ea97e7009f70e12622fa76835.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"41\" height=\"12\" /> because they are all positive, this covers all possible values of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />. Now, we use these properties on all variables.\n</p><p>Assume that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/2/8/128206b7583760e7ef76e802861294c334f7ca2b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0&lt;x&lt;1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"76\" height=\"13\" />. By <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/f/62f62a19f0425d8e6121ca0c1cfd3ce96e43c9c5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(2)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"21\" height=\"18\" />, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/9/8/b9845c168b2536a28057556dfc680eef7f658833.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y&gt;1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"42\" height=\"15\" />, and by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/d/9/0d9c3b1c142cbd3f8217dabc160c57e4750df241.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"21\" height=\"18\" />, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/9/2/292b013918f3fba4ec6b461a81c818e673ee5adf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0&lt;z&lt;1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"78\" height=\"15\" />. Finally, by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/f/62f62a19f0425d8e6121ca0c1cfd3ce96e43c9c5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(2)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"21\" height=\"18\" />, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/6/d/66db4e19b3be56d841f02880243f258ec5d1e88b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x&gt;1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"42\" height=\"12\" />, a contradiction, so no solutions exist in this case.\n</p><p>Similarly, assume that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/6/d/66db4e19b3be56d841f02880243f258ec5d1e88b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x&gt;1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"42\" height=\"12\" />. By <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/d/9/0d9c3b1c142cbd3f8217dabc160c57e4750df241.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"21\" height=\"18\" />, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/8/e/48eaf84d61d401216862cc751740724511e8a317.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0&lt;y&lt;1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"78\" height=\"17\" />, and by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/f/62f62a19f0425d8e6121ca0c1cfd3ce96e43c9c5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(2)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"21\" height=\"18\" />, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/f/2/cf27b25b0af3fcd6657702aeb9fe135ba6623994.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z&gt;1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"41\" height=\"12\" />. Finally, by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/d/9/0d9c3b1c142cbd3f8217dabc160c57e4750df241.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"21\" height=\"18\" />, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/2/8/128206b7583760e7ef76e802861294c334f7ca2b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0&lt;x&lt;1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"76\" height=\"13\" />, a contradiction, so no solutions exist in this case either.\n</p><p>As a result, this leaves <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/f/9/0f9fa1129cb38517beada9aec067527cde7b87ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{(1,1,1)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"69\" height=\"29\" /> as our only solution.\n</p><p>~ <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php/User:Eevee9406\">eevee9406</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_OIM_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=OIM_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"OIM Problems and Solutions\">OIM Problems and Solutions</a>\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018002157\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.016 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.026 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 183/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 6277/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:26264:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018002157 and revision id 245933. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}